Package: snapshot-fieldkit
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, fdisk, jq, rsync, util-linux
Recommends: dosfstools, exfatprogs, udisks2
Description: SnapshOT field triage kit and host-side USB tooling
 Operator-prepared USB triage kit for OT/ICS engagements: read-only forensic
 collectors for Windows (PowerShell 2.0 and a cmd.exe fallback) and Linux
 (POSIX sh, BusyBox-safe), plus host-side commands on the SnapshOT laptop to
 prepare the stick, refresh the kit and import results into a case folder with
 integrity checks. Ships no third-party collectors; the operator supplies those.
